  "description": "Ju-Hyuk is an ordinary office worker getting into a lot of trouble. First, he gets dragged into playing guitar for a band. Then, he clashes with Hee-Jae, one of his bandmates, relentlessly. After that, he gets rental scammed and kicked out of his home. And the cherry on top of this sweet train wreck: he moves into a new place...as Haee-jae’s roommate. It would be great if the trouble stopped there, but things are about to get really, really harder.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
